INSTRUCTIONS
Create the image from this AHM structure.
Treat the defined objects, relations, constraints, and verification checks as required.
Do not add extra primary objects.

DESCRIPTION
Scene: Five-gear technical demonstration

KEY
O = OBJECT
R = RELATION
C = CONSTRAINT
V = VERIFY

OBJECTS
O:G1:Large_Gear
O:G2:Small_Gear
O:G3:Large_Gear
O:G4:Small_Gear
O:G5:Large_Gear

RELATIONS
R:G1>G2:MESHES_WITH
R:G2>G3:MESHES_WITH
R:G3>G4:MESHES_WITH
R:G4>G5:MESHES_WITH

COMPOSITION
G1 is leftmost.
G5 is rightmost.
All five gears form one visible horizontal chain.

CONSTRAINTS
C::GEAR_COUNT=5
C::NO_EXTRA_GEARS
C::ALL_FIVE_GEARS_VISIBLE

VERIFY
V::COUNT_GEARS=5
V::CHECK_CHAIN=G1>G2>G3>G4>G5
